      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This prayer, initially delivered by Rabbi Joseph Baron as an invocation at the opening of the 12th U.A.W.-C.I.O. Labor Convention in Milwaukee, July 1949, was included in the anthology, <tei:hi rend="italic">The Prayer Book of the Armed Forces</tei:hi> (ed. Daniel A. Poling, 1951), pp. 81-82. The prayer was selected for the anthology by Walter P. Reuther (1907-1970), a Lutheran, a leader of organized labor, and a civil rights activist who built the United Automobile Workers (UAW) into one of the most progressive labor unions in American history.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_44921_notes"/>
